bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/bank_import_delete.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-no[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-no/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob expands ~ and glob patterns in bank import FILE operands[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]expand[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]expand: add a shared native::host_paths operand expander (tilde, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]literal-first glob, dedupe, no-match refusal) and adopt it in bob bank [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]import. Also light up the \"bank\" Command Mode invalidation tag, filter [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completion to exports, add a macOS privacy hint for unreadable files, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and document file patterns.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The -D/--delete flag, its delete gate, output, JSON, and docs[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]delete[dim] · [dim][/dim]after expand[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]delete: add -D/--delete with an up-front check of each file, a gate that[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deletes only after the batch succeeds and only files whose bytes still [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]match their digest, per-file outcomes, colored human output, an additive[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]JSON `delete` object, exit codes, and the docs/bank.md and Monday guide [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rewrite.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bank card weekly-import button opens the Command Mode preview[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after delete[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]card: in bob-plugins, turn the bank queue card's static \"Weekly import\" [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]footer text into a one-click chip. The chip opens the Command Mode [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]preview of `bank import -D ~/Downloads/*.qfx` and shows a fallback [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notice only when Command Mode is unavailable.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-no","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-no.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-776ba0fead79002840e48997e292826d","started_at":"2026-11-19T19:48:53.186243+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1795125675,"sha":"c94a718d3ca186696b872a5878b8176090b03460","subject":"feat(bank): add import -D/--delete with digest-gated cleanup"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"61d12f63e64295f89882d7d921d182a2182812078f2139b80c6b57c2f5b00dd8","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-no.2/chat.md","size_bytes":4326},"commits":{"digest":"cbcc1afcb7b4d6329bf757be048aac49a442b61ce39c103bef7e1c9d50429330","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-no.2/commits.json","size_bytes":238},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-no.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"ac4561b40caaef54942dba3f6452099ca1b07d01c05d04906b68546b65570632","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-no.2/meta.json","size_bytes":703},"prompt":{"digest":"5aaf64fa15fbf13ada10587b4d620797e6d544eb9834c5b5866f5662b84660c6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-no.2/prompt.md","size_bytes":176},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"92cac68e1c97f8fcab4917d21cd1488f30abdf745a8da0597f7e314b04e1f6f8","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-no.2/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":6921},"state":{"digest":"6435f639289d8d007e96b5ed0a780d652de5dfb39b74ce4d1b349b9d